WEBVTT

00:14:29.996 --> 00:14:32.996
but is it as boring as

00:14:32.996 --> 00:14:34.996
having to use a condom every time you have sex,

00:14:34.996 --> 00:14:36.996
no matter how drunk you are,

00:14:36.996 --> 00:14:39.996
no matter how many poppers you've taken, whatever?

00:14:39.996 --> 00:14:41.996
If we look at the data, we can see that

00:14:41.996 --> 00:14:43.996
the answer to that question

00:14:43.996 --> 00:14:45.996
is, mmm.

00:14:45.996 --> 00:14:47.996
So these are data from Scotland.

00:14:47.996 --> 00:14:49.996
You see the peak in drug injectors

00:14:49.996 --> 00:14:51.996
before they started the national needle exchange program.

00:14:51.996 --> 00:14:53.996
Then it came way down.

00:14:53.996 --> 00:14:55.996
And both in heterosexuals -- mostly in commercial sex --

00:14:55.996 --> 00:14:57.996
and in drug users,

00:14:57.996 --> 00:15:00.996
you've really got nothing much going on after treatment begins,